From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: kio: carry the translated messages of a launch whose GPU cannot be applied

The seven messages added by
EDITION-ONLY-start-no-application-whose-GPU-cannot-be-applied.patch (ORDER
346g): the program that was not started, and why the Graphics page's
sparky-stereo-gpu-env could not apply its GPU, in Polish, Brazilian
Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean and Chinese (Simplified and
Traditional); English stays in the code. The wording follows the published
lines of sparky-stereo-gpu-run, which say the same failures from the command
line. A first draft with AI assistance, pending review by native speakers.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
---
